  "goodToKnow": "Der Berufsverkehr is rush-hour traffic, when commuters travel to and from work: im morgendlichen Berufsverkehr. Synonyms: die Rushhour, die Hauptverkehrszeit. Germany has about 20 million Pendler (commuters) who cross municipal boundaries for work, and the 49-euro Deutschlandticket, now more expensive, was introduced in 2023 to get them onto trains. It has no plural."
